{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:59 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:59 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:59 2026-10-01 HKT</p><p>西環域多利道近摩星嶺徑交界，周四（10月1日）晚上10時半左右，一部私家車與一部電單車相撞，電單車司機倒地，重創昏迷。救護員到場後，將鐵騎士送往瑪麗醫院搶救。</p><p>現場所見，鐵騎士倒地位置血跡斑斑，一名懷疑私家車男司機正接受警員查問。目前意外原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"鐵騎士倒地位置血跡斑斑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d513a67ea52a1a9ff432f728ee1e95aa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_23_10_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為西環域多利道近摩星嶺徑交界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6810206aa683178b7b97e52bfcf6261b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_23_10_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為西環域多利道近摩星嶺徑交界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c5b4e1aace70aed59546aefd109a67f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_23_10_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一名懷疑私家車男司機正接受警員查問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01663f416914bc47a447e3f186f3ccb6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_23_10_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事私家車車頭損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eee20c40d062edf2f37316b9d211a689/2026-10/55.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事私家車車頭損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab5c2a66ee51221f254adf4cd576ed80/2026-10/66.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事電單車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/efdcf50b21ffbd4193e435703ec199bc/2026-10/7_2.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一名懷疑私家車男司機正接受警員查問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd914959f94cfeec77bbb590026a57cb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_23_10_01_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T16:50:00.786830+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}